WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
Once you have the perspective 
that life is&nbsp;dance, 

00:00:03.897 --> 00:00:07.649
You'll begin to see dance everywhere
 around you, all day long, like I do.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.981
When I&nbsp;choreograph for film, 
television and commercials,

00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:14.635
I often generate moves that are 
based on the human&nbsp;experience.

00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:17.624
I take these moves, I string them together,

00:00:17.624 --> 00:00:19.483
twist and play with their pace,

00:00:19.483 --> 00:00:21.575
in order&nbsp;to create more meaningful work.

00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:25.072
Here's a music video, "Chandelier," 
that I choreographed for Sia,

00:00:25.072 --> 00:00:27.660
featuring the incredible dancer Maddie Ziegler.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.304
And fork, fork, fork, stab it in the wall,

00:00:31.304 --> 00:00:35.132
toss it and pass out, come to and look;

00:00:35.132 --> 00:00:37.816
Charlie Chaplin, Charlie Chaplin, 
cockroach&nbsp;up the wall,

00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:39.122
clean your mustache,

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.141
a possum, sink ...

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.974
Is it time for lunch yet?

00:00:42.974 --> 00:00:46.160
I'd love&nbsp;to invite you to be
 your own choreographer.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.696
Let fun and laughter push the
 boundaries of&nbsp;ridiculousness.

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:51.611
Who knows?

00:00:51.611 --> 00:00:54.629
Maybe brushing your teeth or 
whisking up mac and cheese

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:56.556
will become your new favorite dance move.

